2. **Density of water**: 1000 kg/m³ (assumed for this calculation, actual density at this depth may vary slightly)
3. **Pressure = Density × Gravity × Depth**
   \[
   P = 1000 \, \text{kg/m}^3 \times 9.81 \, \text{m/s}^2 \times 10,994 \, \text{m} = 107,800,000 \, \text{Pa}
   \]
