   \[
   N = \frac{M}{2}
   \]
   For \( H_2SO_4 \), the equivalence weight is \( \frac{98}{2} = 49 \) g/mol.
   \[
   M = 2 \times N = 2 \times 2.00 = 4.00 \, \text{M}
   \]
