b) **Cross-sectional**: This is a **cross-sectional** study because data on eating habits and general health are collected at a single point in time. It is a snapshot of the relationship between these variables at that specific moment.

c) **Propective**: This is a **proieictive** study because it follows a group of people over time, observing their exposure (eating and exchange habits) and assessing the development of a particular illness (cancer) in the future.

