\int \left(\frac{1}{3}\sin t + \cos t\right) e^{-t/2} \, dt = -\frac{2}{3} e^{-t/2} \cos t + \frac{2}{3} \int e^{-t/2} \cos t \, dt + 2e^{-t/2} \sin t + 2 \int e^{-t/2} \sin t \, dt.
