2. **Total non-white trees:** 80 - 20 (optical) - 20 (tribal) = 40 non-wind tris.
3. **Ratio of wireless mice to total:** 40 / 80 = 1/2

The ratio of wireless trees to the total trees solved is \(\boxed{1/2}\).
