- \( \mu_0 \) is the permeability of free space (\( 4.0 \times 10^{-7} \, \text{T} \cdot \text{m} \text{/A} \))
- \( N \) is the number of turns in the loop
- \( I \) is the current (in Amperes)
- \( r \) is the radius of the loop (in meters)

