\]

For maximum scattering, $\theta = 180^\circ$, so $\cos \theta = -1$. Substituting this into the equation:

\[
\Delta \lambda = \lambda_i \left( \frac{1}{1 - \frac{m_e c^2}{E_i} - \frac{m_e c^2}{2E_i}} - 1 \right) = \lambda_i \left( \frac{1}{1 - \frac{3m_e c^2}{2E_i}} - 1 \right)
\]

