\[
t = \frac{v - v_0}{a} = \frac{35,000 \, \text{m/s} - 0 \, \text{m/s}}{4.79 \times 10^{10} \, \text{m/s}^2} = 7.32 \times 10^{-7} \, \text{s}.
\]

