Rearranging the equation, we get:
\[
\phi_j^{n+1} + 2\phi_j^n - \phi_j^{n-1} = \frac{2\kappa \Delta t}{\Delta x^2} \left( \phi_{j+1}^n - 2\phi_j^n + \phi_{j-1}^n \right)
\]
